    <!-- 1. INTRODUCTION -->
    <section id="introduction">
      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>SafeHSE</strong> ("we", "our", "us", or "the App").
        SafeHSE is an educational mobile application designed to help industrial
        safety professionals, students, and job seekers study safety concepts,
        practice multiple-choice questions, take mock tests, and prepare for
        HSE (Health, Safety, and Environment) interviews.
      </p>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it,
        and the choices you have. By using SafeHSE, you agree to the practices
        described in this policy.
      </p>
      <div class="callout callout-info">
        <strong>Short version:</strong> SafeHSE works offline. Your study
        progress, bookmarks, notes, and test results stay
        <span class="highlight">only on your device</span>. We do not collect or
        sell your personal data. The App shows advertisements through
        <strong>Google AdMob</strong>, which separately collects limited device
        and advertising data as described in
        <a href="#advertising">Section 4</a>.
      </div>
      <p>If you do not agree with this policy, please do not use the App.</p>
    </section>

