          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Google Play</td>
            <td>App distribution</td>
            <td><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/privacy</a></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p>
        The current version of SafeHSE does not integrate analytics, social
        plugins, or any other third-party SDKs beyond the advertising and
        distribution services above.
      </p>
      <p>
        If future versions add third-party services (for example, cloud storage,
        authentication, or crash reporting), we will list them here and update
        the "Last updated" date at the top of this policy.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 11. CHANGES -->
    <section id="changes">
      <h2>11. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in
        the App or in applicable law. When we make material changes, we will:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Update the "Last updated" date at the top.</li>
